{"data":[{"author_id":"1229453490537107457","created_at":"2023-12-13T15:47:04.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1734963155204468828"],"id":"1734963155204468828","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1569,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"大家停下手头上的事情 听我说：\n我是买香水大王！！！\n（上床了没拍照片 下次一定）\n（妈的给我自己好闻死咯）","url":"https://x.com/HnrBB2nai/status/1734963155204468828"},{"author_id":"1229453490537107457","created_at":"2023-12-12T15:05:11.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1734590226285433332"],"id":"1734590226285433332","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1634,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我现在有四个选择\nA直接开铲\nB更新我又鸽了很久的小说\nCp最近两天出去玩的照片\nD做去台湾的攻略\n好难决定… 一边铲一边思考","url":"https://x.com/HnrBB2nai/status/1734590226285433332"},{"author_id":"1229453490537107457","created_at":"2023-12-11T18:59:20.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1734286761923317814"],"id":"1734286761923317814","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4309,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"区区完胜\n不值一提\n让你妈的赌心之钢！！！ https://t.co/RIbtIbxXKI","url":"https://x.com/HnrBB2nai/status/1734286761923317814"},{"author_id":"1229453490537107457","created_at":"2023-12-11T13:34:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1734204894465450180"],"id":"1734204894465450180","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1494,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"六千字的论文\n撑死两千字是我自己写的\n谁见了不尊称我一声好裁缝","url":"https://x.com/HnrBB2nai/status/1734204894465450180"},{"author_id":"1229453490537107457","created_at":"2023-12-10T19:39:54.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1733934586328129777"],"id":"1733934586328129777","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":22328,"like_count":48,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":14,"retweet_count":0},"text":"你妈\n每次有想做台本娘的冲动 \n就看一看推上的台本娘 …\n发现厉害的妈妈们实在是太他妈多了\n好他妈的牛 \n我做个鸡巴我还……\n我就会疯狂内耗： 算了不做➡️妈的想做➡️我他妈废物一个做个屁\n假如有一天真的把本子发出来了 又会隔十分钟就上推\n看看有没有老师录我的本子\n操他爹的敏感玻璃心真该死","url":"https://x.com/HnrBB2nai/status/1733934586328129777"},{"author_id":"1229453490537107457","created_at":"2023-12-10T13:55:20.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1733847871416594497"],"id":"1733847871416594497","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1875,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"之前有一段时间很喜欢福克斯的庆功酒\n健身听 写黄文也听\n导致我现在写论文循环到这首歌的时候\n想在跑步机上搞点黄色……\n怎么不能算是 巴普洛夫的狗呢","url":"https://x.com/HnrBB2nai/status/1733847871416594497"},{"author_id":"1229453490537107457","created_at":"2023-12-10T12:07:35.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1733820756298244482"],"id":"1733820756298244482","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1733,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"写完这篇屌论文 \n我要写20年本子 来发泄我压抑的内心\n操你妈的\n脑子里全部是黄色的东西 \n根本没有办法集中注意力\n准备把这群搞学术的人捆起来拿鞭子狠狠抽\n每个字都认识 也都看得懂\n就是写不出来 只能当裁缝\n你妈 耽误我玩铲","url":"https://x.com/HnrBB2nai/status/1733820756298244482"},{"author_id":"1229453490537107457","created_at":"2023-12-09T18:43:40.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1733558046457319525"],"id":"1733558046457319525","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1424,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我有一个脑洞…………\n要不要直觉写一个把jj玩坏的\n可是好像又不适合写进我的任何一个\n同人本子里…………\n哇 难搞","url":"https://x.com/HnrBB2nai/status/1733558046457319525"},{"author_id":"1229453490537107457","created_at":"2023-12-09T14:45:03.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1733497996552360311"],"id":"1733497996552360311","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1380,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"不狂了 \n老八走的……","url":"https://x.com/HnrBB2nai/status/1733497996552360311"},{"author_id":"1229453490537107457","created_at":"2023-12-09T10:01:38.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1733426669963334130"],"id":"1733426669963334130","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4022,"like_count":0,